            <ArticleTitle>Coronary angioplasty in a patient with a prior Bentall procedure.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>353-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We reported a case of percutaneous coronary intervention in a patient with a prior Bentall procedure. We observed a neointimal layer with intracoronary ultrasound during a successful intervention procedure through a composite graft 11 years after the Bentall operation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
